            { text: "When you hear a no, does something in you move forward, or back? It is quick." },
            { text: "What does a no actually feel like in your body? Not what you think about it. Where does it land?" },
            { text: "What does a yes feel like? Most people find out it is not where they expected." },
            { text: "And the real one. How hard is it to say no to something you want to say yes to?", emphasis: "bold" },
            { text: "Because if you cannot say no when you mean it, nobody can trust your yes. Not them, and not you.", emphasis: "accent" },
