            { text: "Round one takes the sting out of a no by making it meaningless." },
            { text: "Round two builds yearning, which is the thing most long relationships have quietly lost.", emphasis: "bold" },
            { text: "Not following through is what does it. A yes that goes nowhere stays in the body for hours." },
          ],
